MessageQ API.

USAGE:
  scw messageq <command>

AVAILABLE COMMANDS:
  deployment  Manage your MessageQ deployment
  endpoint    Manage your MessageQ deployment endpoints
  node-type   List available node types
  user        Manage your MessageQ deployment users
  version     List your MessageQ versions

FLAGS:
  -h, --help                help for messageq
      --list-sub-commands   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -c, --config string    The path to the config file
  -D, --debug            Enable debug mode
  -o, --output string    Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string   The config profile to use

Use "scw messageq [command] --help" for more information about a command.
